This is an example of how one can wrap some of Eigen into a C library, and so
effect an introduction between two parties who, though of the same trade, have
hitherto moved in very different circles.

To try this with GCC, do:

  g++ -c binary_library.cpp -O2 -msse2 -I ../..
  gcc example.c binary_library.o -o example -lstdc++
  ./example

